From ead85f27bb98630d7d78a63651b5bd6de53c55b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 07:23:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Android: keep the page above the keyboard

Capacitor's edge-to-edge margins keep the page between the system bars
but not above the keyboard, so typing covered the message box. The
WebView's insets listener now adds the keyboard's height to the bottom
margin, and the activity asks for adjustResize so that height arrives.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BsPQjebYqr1zAAhxWA3F3b
